<p style="max-width:990px; padding-top:15px">'''MLBB Women's Invitational''' is the World Championship of the Female MLBB scene in 2024. It was announced as part of the '''Esports World Cup''' line-up on January 23, 2024.<ref name="EWC MLBB">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ESWCgg/status/1749763988475269462|title=Let's get ready for a HOT summer!|date=2024-01-23|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>
:''See [https://liquipedia.net/esports/Esports_World_Cup/2024 here] to read about the Esports World Cup 2024, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

