===Format===
<section begin="GSFormat"/>
*'''Group Stage''': ''July 24th - 25th, 2024''
** 12 teams are split into 4 groups of 3 teams.
** Single round robin, all matches are played in a {{Abbr/Bo2}}.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|''Group Top 2''}} advances to Playoffs.
** {{Bgcolortext|down|''Bottom Group''}} are eliminated.
**<span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here to know the '''Group Stage''' tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="width:760px; margin-left:45px">
If somehow 2 or 3 teams have the same score, there will be tiebreaker to decide the ranking
* '''2-way Tiebreaker'''
** The Decider Match will be played in a {{Abbr/Bo1}}.
</div><section end="GSFormat"/>
<section begin="POFormat"/>
*'''Playoffs''': ''July 26th - 27th, 2023''
**Single-elimination bracket.
**All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
**Semifinals and Grandfinals are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.<section end="POFormat"/>

