==Format==
<section begin="WCFormat"/>
* '''Wildcard:''' ''July 10th - 13th 2025''
*** Eight teams will be randomly drawn into two groups
**** Draw order: A → B → A → B until all teams are drawn.
*** Double Elimination, all matches are played in {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 team from each group}} advances to the Wildcard Playoffs
** '''Wildcard Playoffs'''
*** Four teams will play in a single elimination bracket
*** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}
*** {{Bgcolortext|up|The Winner}} qualifies to the Group Stage<section end="WCFormat"/><section begin="GSFormat"/>
* '''Group Stage:''' ''July 23rd - 27th, 2025''
** Sixteen teams will be randomly drawn into two groups
*** Draw order: Pool 2 teams drawn first in A → B → A → B order, then Pool 1 teams
*** '''Region Protection''' (no teams from same region can be in same group)
**** '''Pool 1''': {{LeagueIconSmall/mpl indonesia v3|name=MPL ID S15|link=MPL/Indonesia/Season 15}} MPL ID, {{LeagueIconSmall/mpl philippines v5|name=MPL PH S15|link=MPL/Philippines/Season 15}} MPL PH, {{LeagueIconSmall/mpl malaysia v3|name=MPL MY S15|link=MPL/Malaysia/Season 15}} MPL MY, 1st place of {{LeagueIconSmall/mcc v2|name=MCC S5|link=MLBB_Continental_Championships/Season_5}} MCC (EECA) and {{LeagueIconSmall/msl myanmar|name=MSL S1|link=MLBB_Super_League/Season_1}} MSL MM
**** '''Pool 2''': All remaining teams and Wildcard winner<br><span style="line-height:24px">&nbsp;''[https://youtu.be/RyEMynMoh4A?t=14546 Click here to watch the '''LIVE GROUP STAGE DRAW''']''</span>
** Double Elimination, all matches are played in {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} from each group advances to the Knockout Stage
** {{Bgcolortext|down|Remaining 4 teams}} from each group are eliminated<section end="GSFormat"/><section begin="KOFormat"/>
* '''Knockout Stage:''' ''July 30th - August 2nd, 2025''
** Eight teams will play in a single elimination bracket
*** Each 2-0 team selects a 2-1 opponent
*** Pick order is determined by [[MSC/2025#Game_Records|total/average winning time]] in group stage<br><span style="line-height:24px">&nbsp;''[https://youtu.be/huLoGvppSsY?t=26418 Click here to watch the '''LIVE KNOCKOUT STAGE DRAW''']''</span>
*** All matches are played in {{Abbr/Bo5}} except;
*** The Grand Final will be played in {{Abbr/Bo7}}<section end="KOFormat"/>

