<p style="max-width:990px; padding-top:15px">'''MLBB Women's International''', also known as '''MWI''', is the World Championship of the Female MLBB scene in 2026. It was announced as part of the '''Esports World Cup''' line-up on January 21, 2026. Previously known as '''MLBB Womens' Invitational''', the tournament name has changed to fit as the World Championship tournament for the female players. <br>
<br>
The tournament was originally planned to be hosted in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia. Following an extended evaluation process in light of the current regional situation, the location was moved to Paris, France on May 20.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/2057121960623006162|title=Esports World Cup 2026 is coming to Paris|author=Esports World Cup|author-link=Esports World Cup|date=2026-05-20}}</ref>
